<<<
footing. We have not the smallest doubt that this is what will actually happen, & ... we may discuss the stiuation on the footing that the respective fates of these two bills will be as predicted.
===
**footing.** *We have not the smallest doubt that this is what will actually happen, & . . . we may discuss the situation* on the footing that *the respective fates of these two bills will be as predicted.*
>>>

<<<
